    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to monero 0.18.5.0 (wallet reserve/spend-proof fixes, zmq restricted-RPC checks, p2p sync race fix, multisig kex fix, ledger Nano Gen5; UPnP support removed upstream). Packaging cleanup: drop the now-dead libminiupnpc BuildRequires, convert BuildRequires to pkgconfig() style, drop obsolete Group tags.</comment>
